[
  {
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:01.768",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 1.768,
    "text": "How do you get better at small talk?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:01.768",
    "end": "00:00:05.038",
    "start_seconds": 1.768,
    "end_seconds": 5.038,
    "text": "Because as an introvert, it can be hard work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:05.038",
    "end": "00:00:08.675",
    "start_seconds": 5.038,
    "end_seconds": 8.675,
    "text": "I'm going to talk about the three things that you probably haven't heard of of how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.675",
    "end": "00:00:13.680",
    "start_seconds": 8.675,
    "end_seconds": 13.68,
    "text": "to make small talk feel easy, effortless, and kind of like all the naturals do it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:13.880",
    "end": "00:00:15.749",
    "start_seconds": 13.88,
    "end_seconds": 15.749,
    "text": "small talk as an introvert"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.749",
    "end": "00:00:19.619",
    "start_seconds": 15.749,
    "end_seconds": 19.619,
    "text": "is one of the hardest things to get over because it just sucks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.619",
    "end": "00:00:20.520",
    "start_seconds": 19.619,
    "end_seconds": 20.52,
    "text": "I want to go deep."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.520",
    "end": "00:00:22.856",
    "start_seconds": 20.52,
    "end_seconds": 22.856,
    "text": "I want to jump in. I want to skip the foreplay."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.856",
    "end": "00:00:23.790",
    "start_seconds": 22.856,
    "end_seconds": 23.79,
    "text": "But you can't."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.790",
    "end": "00:00:25.191",
    "start_seconds": 23.79,
    "end_seconds": 25.191,
    "text": "Not in this society."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.191",
    "end": "00:00:27.494",
    "start_seconds": 25.191,
    "end_seconds": 27.494,
    "text": "There's a lot of people who need something more."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.494",
    "end": "00:00:30.530",
    "start_seconds": 27.494,
    "end_seconds": 30.53,
    "text": "And so I went on a little bit of research to find out what is it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.964",
    "end": "00:00:33.133",
    "start_seconds": 30.964,
    "end_seconds": 33.133,
    "text": "How do you actually get better at Small talk?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.133",
    "end": "00:00:34.768",
    "start_seconds": 33.133,
    "end_seconds": 34.768,
    "text": "And I came up with these three things."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:34.768",
    "end": "00:00:35.935",
    "start_seconds": 34.768,
    "end_seconds": 35.935,
    "text": "That's what I'm going to share in this video."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.935",
    "end": "00:00:37.237",
    "start_seconds": 35.935,
    "end_seconds": 37.237,
    "text": "Stick around for number three."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:37.237",
    "end": "00:00:39.873",
    "start_seconds": 37.237,
    "end_seconds": 39.873,
    "text": "I promise that one is the most important one."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.873",
    "end": "00:00:44.210",
    "start_seconds": 39.873,
    "end_seconds": 44.21,
    "text": "And it took me forever to learn it because I thought only one and two mattered."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.644",
    "end": "00:00:46.379",
    "start_seconds": 44.644,
    "end_seconds": 46.379,
    "text": "But it's more than that. So here we go."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.379",
    "end": "00:00:51.251",
    "start_seconds": 46.379,
    "end_seconds": 51.251,
    "text": "Number one, It's the belief that anybody has common interest with you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.451",
    "end": "00:00:52.152",
    "start_seconds": 51.451,
    "end_seconds": 52.152,
    "text": "It's the belief"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.152",
    "end": "00:00:55.822",
    "start_seconds": 52.152,
    "end_seconds": 55.822,
    "text": "that there's always something in common between you and another person."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.955",
    "end": "00:00:58.958",
    "start_seconds": 55.955,
    "end_seconds": 58.958,
    "text": "It doesn't matter how different they are, doesn't matter who they are."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:59.025",
    "end": "00:01:03.730",
    "start_seconds": 59.025,
    "end_seconds": 63.73,
    "text": "There is always something in common in your job is to be that bloodhound,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.730",
    "end": "00:01:07.500",
    "start_seconds": 63.73,
    "end_seconds": 67.5,
    "text": "to get after the scent and find that thing that you,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.500",
    "end": "00:01:11.938",
    "start_seconds": 67.5,
    "end_seconds": 71.938,
    "text": "as human beings on this spinning rock, have in common with one another,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.072",
    "end": "00:01:15.375",
    "start_seconds": 72.072,
    "end_seconds": 75.375,
    "text": "and reframing it as it's always possible and there's always"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.375",
    "end": "00:01:18.711",
    "start_seconds": 75.375,
    "end_seconds": 78.711,
    "text": "something is much, much better than man, I don't like this dude."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.711",
    "end": "00:01:20.580",
    "start_seconds": 78.711,
    "end_seconds": 80.58,
    "text": "This dude's kind of bumming me out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.580",
    "end": "00:01:22.182",
    "start_seconds": 80.58,
    "end_seconds": 82.182,
    "text": "Don't have anything in common."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.182",
    "end": "00:01:24.784",
    "start_seconds": 82.182,
    "end_seconds": 84.78399999999999,
    "text": "No, you do, but you have to find it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.784",
    "end": "00:01:26.286",
    "start_seconds": 84.78399999999999,
    "end_seconds": 86.286,
    "text": "And that leads us to tip number two."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.286",
    "end": "00:01:27.020",
    "start_seconds": 86.286,
    "end_seconds": 87.02,
    "text": "How do you find it?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.020",
    "end": "00:01:30.356",
    "start_seconds": 87.02,
    "end_seconds": 90.356,
    "text": "Well, you got to find the why behind the what?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.091",
    "end": "00:01:34.094",
    "start_seconds": 91.09100000000001,
    "end_seconds": 94.094,
    "text": "So they like tennis and you like reading."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.327",
    "end": "00:01:37.163",
    "start_seconds": 94.327,
    "end_seconds": 97.163,
    "text": "Maybe they're two different things, but there is a reason"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.163",
    "end": "00:01:40.066",
    "start_seconds": 97.163,
    "end_seconds": 100.066,
    "text": "that they like what they like. And you like what you like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.066",
    "end": "00:01:42.569",
    "start_seconds": 100.066,
    "end_seconds": 102.569,
    "text": "Can you find the why behind the what?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.569",
    "end": "00:01:46.039",
    "start_seconds": 102.569,
    "end_seconds": 106.039,
    "text": "Maybe they like reading because it puts them in a state of flow"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.039",
    "end": "00:01:48.441",
    "start_seconds": 106.039,
    "end_seconds": 108.441,
    "text": "and the world can kind of disappear for an hour."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.441",
    "end": "00:01:50.009",
    "start_seconds": 108.441,
    "end_seconds": 110.009,
    "text": "Which is exactly why I love tennis,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.009",
    "end": "00:01:52.979",
    "start_seconds": 110.009,
    "end_seconds": 112.979,
    "text": "because I can just get on the court and just be in the zone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.179",
    "end": "00:01:55.482",
    "start_seconds": 113.179,
    "end_seconds": 115.482,
    "text": "And for one hour nothing else matters."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.482",
    "end": "00:01:56.416",
    "start_seconds": 115.482,
    "end_seconds": 116.416,
    "text": "And maybe that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.416",
    "end": "00:02:00.286",
    "start_seconds": 116.416,
    "end_seconds": 120.286,
    "text": "feeling of I just want to escape for a little bit and be in my own bubble."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.487",
    "end": "00:02:03.356",
    "start_seconds": 120.487,
    "end_seconds": 123.356,
    "text": "Hey, maybe that's what we have in common as introverts, I don't know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.356",
    "end": "00:02:05.758",
    "start_seconds": 123.356,
    "end_seconds": 125.758,
    "text": "Find the why behind the what."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.758",
    "end": "00:02:08.828",
    "start_seconds": 125.758,
    "end_seconds": 128.828,
    "text": "Video games and cooking are two different things,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.828",
    "end": "00:02:12.065",
    "start_seconds": 128.828,
    "end_seconds": 132.065,
    "text": "but maybe it's all about feeling immersed in an activity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:12.599",
    "end": "00:02:15.068",
    "start_seconds": 132.599,
    "end_seconds": 135.068,
    "text": "You always have something in common with somebody."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.068",
    "end": "00:02:18.905",
    "start_seconds": 135.068,
    "end_seconds": 138.905,
    "text": "As long as you start to find out why people do what they do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.905",
    "end": "00:02:21.474",
    "start_seconds": 138.905,
    "end_seconds": 141.474,
    "text": "Simon Sinek has that great Ted talk on this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.474",
    "end": "00:02:22.575",
    "start_seconds": 141.474,
    "end_seconds": 142.575,
    "text": "Start with why."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.575",
    "end": "00:02:25.145",
    "start_seconds": 142.575,
    "end_seconds": 145.145,
    "text": "But it doesn't just apply to business and marketing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.145",
    "end": "00:02:29.849",
    "start_seconds": 145.145,
    "end_seconds": 149.849,
    "text": "It's a basic human fundamental idea that it's not about what we do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.849",
    "end": "00:02:34.454",
    "start_seconds": 149.849,
    "end_seconds": 154.454,
    "text": "It's about the motivations that drive the things that make us human."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.889",
    "end": "00:02:36.689",
    "start_seconds": 155.889,
    "end_seconds": 156.689,
    "text": "But what that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.689",
    "end": "00:02:40.627",
    "start_seconds": 156.689,
    "end_seconds": 160.627,
    "text": "leads to is asking a lot of questions, being curious."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.627",
    "end": "00:02:43.196",
    "start_seconds": 160.627,
    "end_seconds": 163.196,
    "text": "These are all great things, and we know this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.196",
    "end": "00:02:47.467",
    "start_seconds": 163.196,
    "end_seconds": 167.46699999999998,
    "text": "However, we can fall into a trap where all we do is ask questions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.467",
    "end": "00:02:51.371",
    "start_seconds": 167.46699999999998,
    "end_seconds": 171.371,
    "text": "be curious, get to know, keep, keep probing, keep asking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.371",
    "end": "00:02:54.174",
    "start_seconds": 171.371,
    "end_seconds": 174.174,
    "text": "And by the end of the night, you've learned so much about the other person."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.174",
    "end": "00:02:56.509",
    "start_seconds": 174.174,
    "end_seconds": 176.50900000000001,
    "text": "They haven't learned anything about you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.509",
    "end": "00:02:57.644",
    "start_seconds": 176.50900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 177.644,
    "text": "Does that sound familiar?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.644",
    "end": "00:03:00.647",
    "start_seconds": 177.644,
    "end_seconds": 180.647,
    "text": "Because that's been my life for ever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.813",
    "end": "00:03:04.651",
    "start_seconds": 180.813,
    "end_seconds": 184.651,
    "text": "And it's frustrating because what if somebody else isn't?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.651",
    "end": "00:03:08.054",
    "start_seconds": 184.651,
    "end_seconds": 188.054,
    "text": "A great question asker isn't curious about you?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.054",
    "end": "00:03:11.591",
    "start_seconds": 188.054,
    "end_seconds": 191.591,
    "text": "I start to feel like, man, I put in all that legwork."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.125",
    "end": "00:03:14.727",
    "start_seconds": 192.125,
    "end_seconds": 194.727,
    "text": "Come on, let's let's make it 5050."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.727",
    "end": "00:03:16.529",
    "start_seconds": 194.727,
    "end_seconds": 196.529,
    "text": "But not everybody is like that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.529",
    "end": "00:03:18.264",
    "start_seconds": 196.529,
    "end_seconds": 198.264,
    "text": "And that's why it's so important."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.264",
    "end": "00:03:21.434",
    "start_seconds": 198.264,
    "end_seconds": 201.434,
    "text": "Tip number three own your interests."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.202",
    "end": "00:03:23.736",
    "start_seconds": 202.202,
    "end_seconds": 203.736,
    "text": "You got to deliver."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.736",
    "end": "00:03:25.972",
    "start_seconds": 203.736,
    "end_seconds": 205.972,
    "text": "You got to bring yourself to the conversation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.972",
    "end": "00:03:28.608",
    "start_seconds": 205.972,
    "end_seconds": 208.608,
    "text": "and talk what you want to talk about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.608",
    "end": "00:03:32.212",
    "start_seconds": 208.608,
    "end_seconds": 212.212,
    "text": "That's the hardest thing for me is to actually say, you know what"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.378",
    "end": "00:03:36.249",
    "start_seconds": 212.378,
    "end_seconds": 216.249,
    "text": "that reminds me of a book I'm reading and let me tell you about it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.349",
    "end": "00:03:40.820",
    "start_seconds": 216.349,
    "end_seconds": 220.82,
    "text": "without asking, without without requesting permission, I'm just going to decide."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.820",
    "end": "00:03:42.188",
    "start_seconds": 220.82,
    "end_seconds": 222.188,
    "text": "We're going to talk a little bit about what"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.188",
    "end": "00:03:44.357",
    "start_seconds": 222.188,
    "end_seconds": 224.357,
    "text": "I want to talk about, and I'll get some feelers out."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.357",
    "end": "00:03:48.528",
    "start_seconds": 224.357,
    "end_seconds": 228.528,
    "text": "if you want to enjoy speaking, then you got to speak about what you enjoy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:49.329",
    "end": "00:03:50.597",
    "start_seconds": 229.329,
    "end_seconds": 230.597,
    "text": "It's the only way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.597",
    "end": "00:03:53.633",
    "start_seconds": 230.597,
    "end_seconds": 233.633,
    "text": "Small talk for it to be really something you like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.766",
    "end": "00:03:56.035",
    "start_seconds": 233.766,
    "end_seconds": 236.035,
    "text": "You got to like talking about something"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.035",
    "end": "00:03:59.172",
    "start_seconds": 236.035,
    "end_seconds": 239.172,
    "text": "you enjoy, like it's got to also fulfill you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.172",
    "end": "00:04:02.275",
    "start_seconds": 239.172,
    "end_seconds": 242.275,
    "text": "So talk about the video games, talk about the book you're reading."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.275",
    "end": "00:04:05.979",
    "start_seconds": 242.275,
    "end_seconds": 245.979,
    "text": "Talk about what you saw on TV last night, bring up stuff"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.012",
    "end": "00:04:07.780",
    "start_seconds": 246.012,
    "end_seconds": 247.78,
    "text": "you enjoy because you never know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.780",
    "end": "00:04:09.716",
    "start_seconds": 247.78,
    "end_seconds": 249.716,
    "text": "Other people might enjoy it too,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.716",
    "end": "00:04:12.018",
    "start_seconds": 249.716,
    "end_seconds": 252.018,
    "text": "and it might spark even more interesting direction."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.018",
    "end": "00:04:16.089",
    "start_seconds": 252.018,
    "end_seconds": 256.089,
    "text": "So take that confidence and own your own interest."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:16.089",
    "end": "00:04:18.324",
    "start_seconds": 256.089,
    "end_seconds": 258.324,
    "text": "Don't just be curious about other people."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.324",
    "end": "00:04:20.727",
    "start_seconds": 258.324,
    "end_seconds": 260.727,
    "text": "That's what most introverts tend to do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.727",
    "end": "00:04:24.030",
    "start_seconds": 260.727,
    "end_seconds": 264.03,
    "text": "Also, have the courage to assert yourself and bring up"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.030",
    "end": "00:04:27.033",
    "start_seconds": 264.03,
    "end_seconds": 267.033,
    "text": "some conversation topics of your own that you want to talk about."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.333",
    "end": "00:04:30.937",
    "start_seconds": 267.33299999999997,
    "end_seconds": 270.937,
    "text": "Those are the three tips, and hopefully your small talk will get better"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.970",
    "end": "00:04:32.305",
    "start_seconds": 270.97,
    "end_seconds": 272.305,
    "text": "with a little bit of practice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.305",
    "end": "00:04:36.142",
    "start_seconds": 272.305,
    "end_seconds": 276.142,
    "text": "Just remember to own your interests because it's hard for us"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.142",
    "end": "00:04:39.145",
    "start_seconds": 276.142,
    "end_seconds": 279.145,
    "text": "introverts to do it, but it's going to pay off in the end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.512",
    "end": "00:04:40.313",
    "start_seconds": 279.512,
    "end_seconds": 280.313,
    "text": "Thanks for watching!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.313",
    "end": "00:04:42.515",
    "start_seconds": 280.313,
    "end_seconds": 282.515,
    "text": "Please subscribe and I'll see you next time."
  }
]
